From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pedro Maione <pedro.maione@9elements.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:28:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fansensor: move configuration handling out of the lambda

createSensors() does all of its work inside the callback it passes to
GetSensorConfiguration, a lambda body of over 350 lines. Move that body
into createSensorsFromConfigs() so the following changes can split it
further without reindenting it each time.

The body is only reindented, apart from lines clang-format now joins.
No functional change.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
